    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kūng'ogoha Esau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo nang'hwe ūja na lūgendo lwakwe, bamalaika ba ng'wa Mulungu būmanhya nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo aho wababona ūhaya, “Ī gete ī yenīyī ng'hambī ya ng'wa Mulungu.” Hūna ī lipandī lyenīlo ūlitana “Mahanaimu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mahanaimu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mahanaimu makūlū gaho, ng'hambī ibīlī.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūtūma banhū kūja Seili, mu sī ya Edomu, ū kūlī nkūlūye ū Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbakomeleja alībawīla, “Ūlū mulashike ū kūlī ntaale wane, ū nkūjiwa Esau, mukūhaya, ‘Ū nsese wako ū Yakobo alīhaya gīkī, Naalī kū ng'wa Labani, h'ūko naalikalaga kūshisha makanza aya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha nalī na mitugo, ng'ombe, nzobe, ng'holo, na mbūlī; hama nalī na basese bagosha na bakīma. Na lūūlū nalītūma ī nhūng'wa jenīji ū kūlī nkūjiwa ntaale wane, gīkī napandīke kwanukūlwa ū kū būtongi wako.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū abo akabatūma ū Yakobo aho bashoka būhaya, “Twashika ū kūlī nkūlūyo ū Esau, ī haha alī mu nzīla aliza na banhū magana anè, kūlwa kūkūsūng'wanha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo oogoha no, hama ūzwangana kīngī nasho; a banhū abo walī nabo ūbagabanhya mabità abīlī, pye na a madaale ga mitugo nī ngamīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno akiwīla gīkī, “Ū Esau ūlū ūlīkenaagūla ī libità ī līmò, ī lingī līshikile kūpūlūgūka lyūpeela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūlomba alīhaya, “Ee Mulungu wa ng'wa baba Abulahamu, Mulungu wa ng'wa baba Isaka. Ū bebe h'ūlī SEEBA ūyo ūkaniwīla gīkī, ‘Shokaga kaya kū sī yako na kū badūgūyo, nakūkūbeegeja yawiza.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nsese wako natigeleelilwe ū bebe ūnīītīle ū wiza bose wenūbo, nūūlū kūnoolekeja ū būtogwa wenūbū. Nguno aho nalīgūkīla ū mongo gwenūyū naalī iyene dūhū na nang'ha gwane, alīyo ī haha nalī na mabità abīlī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīkūlomba ūnipīje ū mu nkono gwa nkūlū wane ū Esau, nguno naloogoha; akwiza anidumīle anikenaagūle ū nene na a baana, na a baninabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bebe ng'wenekīlī ūkahaya hape gīkī, ‘Nakūkūbeegeja yawiza;’ na gīkī, ‘Nakūbīīta a banhū ba būbyīle wako babize bingī gītī maseni ga ha nyanza, ayo gatūdūla kūbalwa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manong'ho ga ng'wa Yakobo kūlī Esau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būjikū wa lūshikū lwenūlo ūbūmalīla henaho; ū mu shikolo īsho walī nasho, ūsolanhya shimò na shimò sha kūūnong'ha ū Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasola mbūli magana abīlī na ng'hulyati makūmi abīlī, ng'holo magana abīlī na ng'ondi makūmi abīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūsola na ngamīla ng'hīma makūmi adatū na baana bajo, ng'ombe makūni anè na nzagamba ikūmi, nzobe ng'hīma makūmi abīlī na nzobe ng'hosha ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wajisolanhya ūjitūūla mu makono ga basese bakwe; būlī idaale lyūbiza iyene. Hūna ūbawīla a basese bakwe gīkī, “Tongelagi gwike ng'wilekela ng'wanya a ha gatī y'idaale n'idaale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūbūtongi ūnagīīla ī ya kūhaya; ūng'wīla, “Ū nkūlū wane ū Esau ūlū alakūpuunīle akūbūje gīkī, ‘Ū bebe ūlī wa ng'wa nani? Nū kūko ūjile halī?’ Na gīkī, ‘Ī mitugo jose jenīji ūlījiswaga ja ng'wa nani?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wīlage, ‘Ja nsese wako Yakobo; inong'ho lya kūng'winha nkūjiwa ntaale wakwe Esau, nū wei alīho a ha numa aliza.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū wa kabīlī ūnangīīla gīko, nū wa kadatū, kūshisha pye a bose abo baswagaga madaale; ūbawīla gīkī, “Būlī ūmò wing'we ūlū ūmanhya nū Esau, hayagi mihayo yenīyo dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izūkagwi gete ū kūhaya ī gīkī, ‘Nū wei ū nsese wako ū Yakobo alīho a ha numa aliza.’” Nguno wiganikaga gīkī, “A manong'ho aya nalīntūmīla genaya gakūmpoja, hama naliganika nū nene akūnanukūla ūlū nibona nang'hwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a manong'ho ga ng'wa Yakobo gūtonga, ū wei ng'wenekīlī wikala a ha ng'hambī ū būjikū wenūbo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kwifuka na Munhū būjikū pe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu būjikū wenūbo, ū Yakobo ūbūūka ūbasola a bake bakwe na a bakīma a basese, hamò na a bitūnja bakwe abo ikūmi na ūmò, ūbakīja ū mongo gwa Yaboki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala kūbakīja ū mongo, ūshikīja nī shikolo shakwe pye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ūsaaga iyene ko; munhū nebe wifuka nang'hwe kūshisha būjikū pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo aho wabona gīkī atūng'heebaga ū Yakobo ū mu lifuka, ūnkuumya h'iguha lya lūnyonga lwa lūkunu lwakwe; ū lūnyonga lwa lūkunu lūtyūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūhaya, “Nilekelage naje, weela ū būjikū.” Alīyo ū Yakobo ūshosha, “Ndūhū natūkūlekelaga kūshisha ūnifuuhe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūmūja, “Ī lina lyako ūlī nani?” Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Nalī Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla, “Ī lina lyako ūtitanwa hangī Yakobo, ūlī Isilaeli; nguno wilwishije na banhū nū Mulungu, ūbiza ntindi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūhaya, “Nalīkūlomba ūniwīle ī lina lyako.” Nang'hwe ūnshokeja, “Lyakī ī lina lyane ūlīlībūja?” Hūna ūmfuuha aho balī henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūlitana ī lina ly'ipandī lyenīlo gīkī, “Penieli;” ūhaya, “Nguno nibonaga na Mulungu būshū kū būshū, alīyo nūchīlwa shigongo, nī haha nataalī nalīho nalī mpanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho līlīfuma ī līīmi nang'hwe ūshimīza kwīnga ī Penieli, akūlibagīlaga kūlwa nguno ya lūkunu lwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene kūshisha lelo īyī a Baisilaeli batalyaga ī nyama ya ha lūge ūlo lūlūnganije ha lūnyonga lwa lūkunu. Nguno ū lūnyonga lwa lūkunu lwa ng'wa Yakobo lūkakuumiwa bbihī nū lūge lwenūlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
